              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "зачёт (zachyót) — \"a pass-or-fail test, a credit\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Завтра у меня зачёт по истории. Závtra u menyá zachyót po istórii. Tomorrow I have a pass-or-fail test in history."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine. A test graded pass or fail, without a mark. Получить зачёт (zachyót) — to pass it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "зачёт (zachyót) is built on зачесть \"to count in, to credit\", on the old root of считать and число \"number\": a test that is counted in or not."
            }
          ]
        },
